も</span> <span begin="04:05.719" end="04:06.359">手放</span><span begin="04:06.359" end="04:06.991">した</span><span begin="04:06.991" end="04:07.734">悲し</span><span begin="04:07.734" end="04:08.119">み</span><span begin="04:08.119" end="04:08.739">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将双手相握的喜悦</span></p><p begin="04:08.815" end="04:15.204" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="04:08.815" end="04:09.562">飽き足ら</span><span begin="04:09.562" end="04:09.946">ず</span><span begin="04:09.946" end="04:11.098">描い</span><span begin="04:11.098" end="04:11.439">てい</span><span begin="04:11.439" end="04:11.761">く</span> <span begin="04:11.885" end="04:12.714">地球儀</span><span begin="04:12.714" end="04:13.048">を</span><span begin="04:13.048" end="04:13.768">回す</span><span begin="04:13.768" end="04:14.207">よう</span><span begin="04:14.207" end="04:15.204">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不厌其烦地描绘着</span></p></div></body></tt>